@@ -9,6 +9,9 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Queue management page (`entity.queues`, owner/admin): create, rename, deactivate/reactivate with a confirmation modal, and per-queue `call` access grants, backed by `CreateQueue`/`UpdateQueue`/`SetQueueAccess`.
+- Attendant serve panel (`entity.serve`, any member): callable-queue selector, waiting list in call order, call modes and rate-limited "Call next" backed by `CallNextTicket`.
+- Members page tabs (members / invites), and "Queues" / "Serve" entries in the navbar dropdown, in `pt_BR` and `en`.
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
